  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Officers are not satisfied that the proposed development&#x27;s design and siting would appear out of the local character at this prominent corner plot, which would result in a disruptive and detrimental impact on the street scene. As such, the proposed development is considered unacceptable and contrary to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (DLUHC, 2023);&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Policies D4 &amp;amp; D8 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Policy CP3 of the LBBD&#x27;s&amp;nbsp;Local Development Framework (LDF) Core Strategy (July 2010);&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Policy BP11 of the LBBD&#x27;s&amp;nbsp;Local Development Framework (LDF) Borough Wide Development Plan Document (DPD) (March 2011); and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Policies SP2, SP4 &amp;amp; DMD1 of the LBBD’s Draft Local Plan (Regulation 19 Submission Version, December 2021).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
